say text, welcome to cfd version two.

set radius to 3 point 14.
set area to radius times radius times 3 point 14.
say text, area is, area.

set greeting to text, hello.
set name to text, world.
say greeting, name.

set x to 10.
if x is greater than 5 and x is at most 20 then
  say text, x is between 6 and 20.
else
  say text, x is out of range.
end.

set counter to 0.
repeat 5 times
  set counter to counter plus 1.
end.
say text, counted to, counter.
